 FOCUS: aux|ちゃう-Inf-S^aux|ない-Inf-Neg-S^aux|た-Inf-S^noun|*
 POINTS: B1 A1 A1 A1 F3
# tabechawanai  B1 A1 A1 F3
### FOCUS: *COMPL-NEG-PRES*^n*|*
 FOCUS: aux|ちゃう-Inf-S^aux|ない-Inf-Neg-S^noun|*
 POINTS: B1 A1 A1 F3
 # tabechatta  B1 A1 F3
